  {
    "question_text": "Evaluate $\\log_{10}18+\\log_{10}72+\\log_{10}288+\\dots+\\log_{10}4608$. Give an exact answer.",
    "solution_text": "$d=\\log_{10}72-\\log_{10}18=\\log_{10}4$.\nAlso, $\\log_{10}288-\\log_{10}72=\\log_{10}4$, so the terms form an AP.\n$4608=18(4^4)$, so there are $5$ terms.\n$a=\\log_{10}18$, $a_n=\\log_{10}18+4\\log_{10}4$.\n$S_5=\\frac{5}{2}(2\\log_{10}18+4\\log_{10}4)$\n$=5\\log_{10}18+10\\log_{10}4$"
